---
title: Bazinga Local Server - Artifact API Code Level
---
classDiagram
    class ArtifactEntry {
        <<bazinga>>
        +name: str
        +path: str
        +type: str
    }

    class ArtifactAPI {
        +list_artifacts(project_path: str) list~ArtifactEntry~
        +read_artifact(project_path: str, rel_path: str) str
    }

    class ArtifactPersistence {
        +save_artifact(project_path: str, rel_path: str, content: str) str
        +read_artifact(project_path: str, rel_path: str) str
        +list_artifacts(project_path: str) list~ArtifactEntry~
    }

    ArtifactAPI ..> ArtifactEntry : returns
    ArtifactAPI --> ArtifactPersistence : reads from repo
    ArtifactPersistence ..> ArtifactEntry : returns
